      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T09:47:29-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Utilities billing, this is Priya. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T09:47:33-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yeah, Dario Rocha, 356 Ocean Avenue. So, my pipe burst, and I was just looking at my phone, which, my lock screen is a picture of my cousin I've never met, long story, anyway. The bill."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T09:47:46-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. What about the bill?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T09:47:49-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's huge. I'm asking about a leak adjustment, since the pipe broke. But I'm not asking you to change anything, I just want it explained."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T09:47:58-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. Did the reading come from the meter or was it estimated?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T09:48:03-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, the meter's in the crawlspace. Nobody goes in there. Nobody. So how does anyone read it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T09:48:10-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Then it likely reports through a remote reader, so the usage is probably real. A leak adjustment is a request reviewed after the repair is documented. I can note your account and send the form."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T09:48:23-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, that's all I wanted. Thanks."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T09:48:26-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Mr. Rocha. Take care."
    }
  ],
